<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '100px 60px 60px 60px', position: 'relative', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif', color: '#1A2230' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 6, background: '#E9ECF3' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 22, width: 900, fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#5A86D6', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>展望　主题前沿四方向详解</Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 950, top: 34, width: 270, fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', textAlign: 'right', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>10 · 前沿</Text>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 84, width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />

    <Box style={{ width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', height: 500, marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 570, flexDirection: 'column', paddingRight: 18 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 552, height: 240, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #D0342C', paddingLeft: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D0342C', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>■ 软件定义无线</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35, marginTop: 2 }}>用软件灵活管控 WiFi，不用改硬件</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 5 }}>把控制逻辑从设备固件抽到可编程层，按时间尺度分层：秒级的慢控制管策略，毫秒级的快控制管调度。</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 3 }}>Daniel 等（2026-06）发布首个带大模型接口的开源 NWDAF：运维用自然语言查状态、订阅事件，自动翻译成指令——但只做「读与订阅」，不自动改配置。</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 3 }}>本组：只读阈值提示属于最慢的控制层，离「软件定义」还差可编程接口。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 552, height: 240, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #D0342C', paddingLeft: 14, justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D0342C', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>■ AI 智能负载均衡</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35, marginTop: 2 }}>AI 自动分配设备，不让某个热点挤爆</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 5 }}>机制：强化学习按实时负载决定「哪个终端连哪个 AP、用哪段信道」，替代静态固定分配。</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 3 }}>Nunez 等（2025）的 PPO 学习式多 AP 调度把 99 分位时延最多降 30%，用户越多优势越大。</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 3 }}>反例：同篇自报低负载下不优于简单启发式；贪心式自适应选路还会损害共存网络——AI 均衡同样要看负载条件。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 590, borderLeft: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 552, height: 240, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #D0342C', paddingLeft: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D0342C', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>■ 无线网络自愈</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35, marginTop: 2 }}>坏了自己排查修复</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 5 }}>从「人工看日志」到「模型检测异常 → 定位根因 → 给修复建议」，目标是发现即处置。</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 3 }}>北航 ICAD-LLM（AAAI 2026）用大模型统一时序 / 表格 / 日志三类异常检测，一次训练多场景适配；RCA Copilot（ICC 2025）结合统计检验与大模型，给出可解释的根因叙述。</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 3 }}>边界：NIKA 基准（2025-12）发现大模型能发现问题、却难定位根因——现状停在诊断辅助，闭环还需校验门与灰度回滚。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 552, height: 240, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #D0342C', paddingLeft: 14, justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D0342C', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>■ 零信任无线接入</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.35, marginTop: 2 }}>连上 WiFi 也不能直接信任，做安全校验</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 5 }}>不再「接入即信任」：每次访问都验证身份与设备状态，隔离可疑终端，把信任边界收窄到每次会话。</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 3 }}>Pasquini 等（2025）的安全分析证明：注入伪造遥测可误导 AI 运维代理执行破坏性动作——越智能的运维，越需要可信遥测与信任边界。</Text>
                <Text style={{ width: 522, fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.38, marginTop: 3 }}>对智能无线运维的启示：先做可信遥测与校验，再谈自动化。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 44, background: '#F4F7FC', borderLeft: '4px solid #5A86D6', justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 16, marginTop: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>■ 收束：理论给边界、实验给证据、应用给场景、前沿给方向与代价——机制不是无条件有效。谢谢，进入提问环节。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 670, width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 678, width: 800, fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>CNC-GR · 10 号　｜　本页直引 6 篇文献（2 篇 2026 年），出处见下一页</Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1060, top: 678, width: 160, fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', textAlign: 'right', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>04 / 05</Text>
</Slide>
